\ boxes.8th -- Thinking 8th, Chapter 6
\ Verified with: 8th code/ch06/boxes.8th
\
\ Compile-time factoring: letting 8th do the arithmetic once, while
\ the source file is being read, rather than writing the already-
\ reduced numbers in by hand.

8 constant wide
4 constant ave

\ centering nine boxes (three per row, two gaps) on an 80-column
\ display: total width is 3 widths + 2 avenues, and the margin is
\ half of whatever's left over.
wide 3 n:* ave 2 n:* n:+ 80 swap n:- 2 n:/ constant leftmargin

leftmargin . cr             \ => 24

\ a table's own length, rather than a hand-counted constant that can
\ drift out of sync with the table.
[ 10 , 20 , 30 , 40 ] constant points
points a:len constant #points

#points . cr                \ => 4

bye
